{"v":1,"book":"Ps","ch":76,"verses":[{"n":0,"text":"For the Chief Musician. On stringed instruments. A Psalm by Asaph. A song."},{"n":1,"text":"In Judah, God is known. His name is great in Israel."},{"n":2,"text":"His tabernacle is also in Salem. His dwelling place in Zion.","tok":[{"t":"His","s":["H3045"]},{"t":" tabernacle "},{"t":"is","s":["H8034"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"also","s":["H8034"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"in","s":["H3478"]},{"t":" Salem. "},{"t":"His","s":["H3045"]},{"t":" dwelling place "},{"t":"in","s":["H3478"]},{"t":" Zion."}]},{"n":3,"text":"There he broke the flaming arrows of the bow, the shield, and the sword, and the weapons of war. Selah.","tok":[{"t":"There","s":["H1961"]},{"t":" he broke "},{"t":"the","s":["H1961"]},{"t":" flaming arrows "},{"t":"of","s":["H1961"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"the","s":["H1961"]},{"t":" bow, "},{"t":"the","s":["H1961"]},{"t":" shield, "},{"t":"and","s":["H6726"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"the","s":["H1961"]},{"t":" sword, "},{"t":"and","s":["H6726"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"the","s":["H1961"]},{"t":" weapons "},{"t":"of","s":["H1961"]},{"t":" war. Selah."}]},{"n":4,"text":"Glorious are you, and excellent, more than mountains of game.","tok":[{"t":"Glorious "},{"t":"are","s":["H4421"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"you","s":["H7665"]},{"t":", "},{"t":"and","s":["H2719"]},{"t":" excellent, "},{"t":"more","s":["H4421"]},{"t":" than mountains "},{"t":"of","s":["H2719"]},{"t":" game."}]},{"n":5,"text":"Valiant men lie plundered, they have slept their last sleep. None of the men of war can lift their hands.","tok":[{"t":"Valiant men lie plundered, they have slept "},{"t":"their","s":["H2964"]},{"t":" last sleep. None "},{"t":"of","s":["H2042"]},{"t":" the men "},{"t":"of","s":["H2042"]},{"t":" war can lift "},{"t":"their","s":["H2964"]},{"t":" hands."}]},{"n":6,"text":"At your rebuke, God of Jacob, both chariot and horse are cast into a dead sleep.","tok":[{"t":"At","s":["H3808"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"your","s":["H3605"]},{"t":" rebuke, "},{"t":"God","s":["H3808"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"of","s":["H3027"]},{"t":" Jacob, "},{"t":"both","s":["H3605"]},{"t":" chariot "},{"t":"and","s":["H3027"]},{"t":" horse "},{"t":"are","s":["H3027"]},{"t":" cast "},{"t":"into","s":["H3027"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"a","s":["H3068"]},{"t":" dead "},{"t":"sleep","s":["H8142"]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":7,"text":"You, even you, are to be feared. Who can stand in your sight when you are angry?","tok":[{"t":"You, even you, "},{"t":"are","s":["H5483"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"to","s":["H3290"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"be","s":["H5483"]},{"t":" feared. Who can stand "},{"t":"in","s":["H7393"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"your","s":["H3290"]},{"t":" sight "},{"t":"when","s":["H3290"]},{"t":" you "},{"t":"are","s":["H5483"]},{"t":" angry?"}]},{"n":8,"text":"You pronounced judgment from heaven. The earth feared, and was silent,","tok":[{"t":"You","s":["H6440"]},{"t":" pronounced judgment "},{"t":"from","s":["H6440"]},{"t":" heaven. "},{"t":"The","s":["H6440"]},{"t":" earth "},{"t":"feared","s":["H3372"],"a":[4]},{"t":", "},{"t":"and","s":["H6440"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"was","s":["H6440"]},{"t":" silent,"}]},{"n":9,"text":"when God arose to judgment, to save all the afflicted ones of the earth. Selah.","tok":[{"t":"when","s":["H8085"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"God","s":["H8064"]},{"t":" arose "},{"t":"to","s":["H8085"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"judgment","s":["H1779"]},{"t":", "},{"t":"to","s":["H8085"]},{"t":" save all "},{"t":"the","s":["H8085"]},{"t":" afflicted ones "},{"t":"of","s":["H3372"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"the","s":["H8085"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"earth","s":["H8064"]},{"t":". Selah."}]},{"n":10,"text":"Surely the wrath of man praises you. The survivors of your wrath are restrained.","tok":[{"t":"Surely","s":["H6965"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"the","s":["H3605"]},{"t":" wrath "},{"t":"of","s":["H3605"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"man","s":["H3605"]},{"t":" praises "},{"t":"you","s":["H3605"]},{"t":". "},{"t":"The","s":["H3605"]},{"t":" survivors "},{"t":"of","s":["H3605"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"your","s":["H3605"]},{"t":" wrath "},{"t":"are","s":["H4941"]},{"t":"